WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:03.590
Essentially, life is a game.

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:08.240
There are natural and manmade laws that serve
as rules.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.510
There is a beginning and an end.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:15.040
There is a game board we play on that we call
planet earth.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:20.110
And there are decisions and moves that we
make that determine where and how we move

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:21.740
on the board.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.320
Of course, we all want to win.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.280
Some of us do, and some of us don’t.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:32.980
But that begs the question, how DOES one win?

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:40.100
Unlike a normal game, there is no time after
life for us to bask in and enjoy a victory.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:47.010
And so, if we wish to truly experience wining
the game of life, we must frame our definition

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:55.080
of how we win accordingly, so that we win
while the game is still in play.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:01:01.850
Winning the game of life is not predicated
merely by the quantity of material successes

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:05.370
that we have accumulated by the end of it.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:13.209
Sure, it is enjoyable and important to acquire
things within the game of life, but the accumulation

00:01:13.209 --> 00:01:21.499
of things like wealth, material excess, fame,
or status tend to easily be confused as the

00:01:21.499 --> 00:01:23.649
ultimate endgame.

00:01:23.649 --> 00:01:24.649
But they are not.

00:01:24.649 --> 00:01:28.310
They are just parts of the game.

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:34.369
And furthermore, each win of this kind is
generally short lived.

00:01:34.369 --> 00:01:40.939
It is just like how winning a board game,
video game, or sports game might feel good

00:01:40.939 --> 00:01:47.700
when it occurs and for a little while after,
but the feeling soon fades and you return

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:50.369
to your normal state.

00:01:50.369 --> 00:01:55.719
And so it is important that the state that
you return to in life is a victory in it of

00:01:55.719 --> 00:01:57.630
itself.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:03.229
In the case of the game of life, not only
is the sense of fulfillment from material

00:02:03.229 --> 00:02:10.341
wins short lived, but the accumulation of
material points does not matter much at the

00:02:10.341 --> 00:02:11.970
end of it.

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:17.319
These points don’t go anywhere with you
when you are dead and gone.

00:02:17.319 --> 00:02:23.769
Instead, it is about how much you enjoyed
the game of pursuing the points in the first

00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:25.150
place.

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:32.400
Ironically, you truly win the game of life
when you realize and embrace that it IS a

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.959
game.

00:02:33.959 --> 00:02:40.109
When you become aware that against all odds,
you were somehow rendered into this existence

00:02:40.109 --> 00:02:47.180
and are now able to play and enjoy the most
enthralling, sophisticated, and entertaining

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:49.390
game ever to exist.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:55.349
A game that is so complex and uncertain that
you can never completely predict what’s

00:02:55.349 --> 00:02:57.519
going to happen next.

00:02:57.519 --> 00:03:00.250
A game that is always updating.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:07.659
A game that you can come up with rules for,
change existing ones, unlock new levels, and

00:03:07.659 --> 00:03:10.760
uncover hidden settings.

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:18.299
And the quality of your life experience truly
maximizes when you realize that you have already

00:03:18.299 --> 00:03:35.499
won by being able to do any 

00:03:35.499 --> 00:03:48.110
of this.

